        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7f-PUEaRtaxbk84LH89Q9-YwXIWripEfxqQMjiFY5JKnxM14Fv27JStUtoLcd2tiiwfC-NU7IfAzR0sCCvfu0dPUUmktRkrUg6WKyWRImsl_IrTXmlBHWpkSyNhaI6lH0Y7mGIgEqKQDReCLcetehK8D6gubZBDpJcx6-Vrrf2DOVAc-ZZmNDGGZh8Pn2J1lTYNdE3zmlo3V-qSjIqcb64mAZXIByQKtaE8a-PvhA48vL3mQ-D5dc3dXseKD6-Q0WutQ8u08-u8QED6zgPXWk0k8QHl_X1yV3NsdnvF3JcZtgLhRL9wjEpXyNNlCCPuv1dyd922fkJW79apvjUgMX-qewXOG7rqhmYb_UahfUiuQQ3xcfT-WWw3SN8PIvBEf_Dy6JHV-VmMzBa2N8Zt6J8AiyaK80GePbXVYki_FhKkIx557ZVGUzC2_-rtJpOWplqdi876IN8RJqKiXFIx-Hlvvjtzgp4Y3WFiUZIkP59qLhVAYs-i526SirZ9xiO51UFs2W-EDpXXdZOoTzyr9bnFCIXRFFPSNIiYYAFpeRSwGooGzH-ippLCrsytmJ0cR33-R0cu2Xi0rI3TYvYs0D-oKdBLbLczvHfooyOXvtf" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>🎟 予約：有料見学区画の有無を公式で確認<br>公式・予約：https://basilicasalutevenezia.it/<br>☔ 雨の日向き｜屋内中心（移動・入場待ちは雨具）<br><br><br>🔵 観光スポット ★★<br>見どころ：大運河沿いの美しい教会<br>料金：本堂見学は通常無料／有料区域あり<br>営業時間：礼拝・行事により見学可能時間変動<br>休み・注意：特別行事など<br>滞在目安：30〜60分<br>近くで回る：アカデミア橋／大運河<br>食べ物：チケッティ<br>お土産：教会関連雑貨<br><br>公式案内 (https://basilicasalutevenezia.it/)<br>Googleマップで開く (https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Basilica%20di%20Santa%20Maria%20della%20Salute%2C%20Venice%2C%20Italy)<br>保存した写真 (https://drive.google.com/file/d/15IwrbYw-bJ-pr7mv8hkuShIvmQdURJq0/view?usp=drivesdk)<br>確認：2026-11-13／訪問日の料金・営業は再確認<br>写真：This Photo was taken by Wolfgang Moroder. Feel free to use my photos, but please mention me as the author and send me a message. This image is not in the public domain. Please respect the copyright protection. It may only be used according to the rules mentioned here. This specifically excludes use in social media, if applicable terms of the licenses listed here are not appropriate. Please do not upload an updated image here without consultation with the Author. The author would like to make corrections only at his own source. This ensures that the changes are preserved.Please if you think that any changes should be required, please inform the author.Otherwise you can uplo